title: Payers › Workflow Builder › Check a workflow before publishing
route: /payers/summit?tab=builder
intro: The checks run on every change, so a step's mark and the list on the right are always current. Problems that make a workflow unsafe to use block publishing. Things worth a look are listed but do not block.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Look at the right panel with no step selected\n('This workflow'), or click 'Publish'"
process p1 "Checks run on the draft as it is on screen, with the payer's rules and the connections it knows"
decision d1 "Anything that blocks?"
screen ok1 "'Checks'\n'No problems found. It can be published.'\nor 'Nothing blocks publishing.' with a fold '3 things to check'"
screen er "Each blocker\n'Needs fixing' and the step's name, one sentence, and 'Go to node'"
screen eg "What blocks publishing\nNo Start, or two, or no End; a step that cannot be reached from Start;\nnothing after a step, or an exit with no line; a path that never reaches an End;\na Decision with no branches; a loop with nothing to wait for, approve or count;\nnothing leading into a trigger; a rule that was deleted or superseded;\nan integration that is not configured and has no manual fallback;\na step that reaches the payer without a person's approval"
click c1 "Click 'Go to node'"
process p2 "The step is selected, the canvas moves to it and its settings open with the same message at the top"
click c2 "Click 'Publish' while something blocks"
toast t1 "Panel shows 'Cannot publish yet: N things need fixing.'\nAnnounced the same way\nNo pop-up opens"
click c3 "Open the fold 'N things to check'"
screen wn "Warnings, each a 'Check' line with 'Go to node'\nA rule that is unverified, marked for review or has ended; a rule step that names no rule;\na step that is a demo simulation or not configured with a manual fallback;\na step with no instructions or an agent with no prompt; a condition with no value;\nan agent review with no approval after it; a workflow whose dates do not match today;\nanother published workflow with the same scope"
decision d2 "Fixed in the draft?"
process p3 "The blocker disappears from the list at once\nThe step's mark goes too"
end e1 "Nothing blocks publishing"
goto g1 "Continues in: Payers › Workflow Builder › Publish a workflow"

s1 --> p1 --> d1
d1 -->|No| ok1 --> c3
d1 -->|Yes| er --> eg
er --> c1 --> p2 --> d2
er --> c2 --> t1 --> c1
d2 -->|Yes| p3 --> ok1
d2 -->|No| er
c3 --> wn --> e1
ok1 --> e1
e1 --> g1
